	(descr "Daisy Seed Rev4 socket, row B (pins 21-40). 1x20 female, 2.54mm. Place A and B exactly 15.24mm apart: the module outline and USB tab are split on the centreline, so a misplacement shows as a broken outline. USB is at the pin-1/pin-40 end; the square pad marks that end on both rows.")
